# 仓库只收录：代码、文档、渲染必需素材、时间轴数据与音频制品。
# 片源、原曲、伴奏、MIDI、参考视频、整片音频分离结果、工具、视频成品一律不入库。

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/requirements.txt
!scripts/
!assets/
!work/
!out/

# work/：只收时间轴 / 转写 / 对齐数据与合成干声；整片音频、切片等中间产物不入库
work/*
!work/timeline.json
!work/spoken.json
!work/whisper.json
!work/stems/
work/stems/*
!work/stems/lead.wav
!work/stems/harm.wav
!work/stems/sub.wav
!work/stems/up.wav
!work/clips/
work/clips/*
!work/clips/index.json
!work/clips/align.json

# out/：只收最终混音；视频预览等成品不入库
out/*
!out/audio_v1.wav

__pycache__/
*.pyc
